# Beast, Erudite Aerialist: "As long as you've put one or more +1/+1 counters on Beast this turn, he has flying." Bot1's
# Snakeskin Veil puts one on him: flying that turn, not the turn after, and only him, not a Memnite beside him. The
# counter Bot2's Revitalizing Repast puts on him is not one Bot1 put, so he stays on the ground. "Whenever Beast deals
# combat damage to a player, draw a card": his hit on turn 3 draws the Memnite.

